    { "a": "Zero-crossing rate", "t": "overfit", "aka": ["ZCR", "zero crossing rate", "zero crossings", "zero-crossings", "zero_crossing_rate"], "q": "How often the waveform changes sign. A cheap noisiness detector: high for hiss, low for vowels." },

